# This project's commit scopes, one per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# `workbench commits check` also accepts Workbench's process scopes (agents, ci, decision, deps,
# docs, guides, policy, proposal, release, rules, skills, templates, treewide, vision) and the
# name of any proposal file: `proposals/<NNNN>-<slug>.md` is the scope `<NNNN>-<slug>`, so
# feature work needs no entry here.
#
# Add product scopes below as the project grows. Prefer the narrowest scope that accurately
# describes the change.

# The command registry, discovery commands, help, and the text and JSON output contract.
cli
# The package commands: install, remove, list, outdated, upgrade, sync, prune, where, and tap.
packages
# Running mise, reading its answers, and editing mise config files.
mise
# The Homebrew and App Store catalogs behind search and info.
catalog
# The release helper crate: archives and the Homebrew formula.
xtask
